e":21.38,"text":"Lord, I’m standing in the fire, but I’m not ash,"},{"s":21.38,"e":24.88,"text":"I’ve been hit by the storm, but I still flash."},{"s":24.88,"e":28.62,"text":"Every chain on my name, let it crack, let it break,"},{"s":28.62,"e":32.32,"text":"Every lie in my mind, let it drown in Your wake."},{"s":32.32,"e":35.64,"text":"I don’t need a whisper, I need heaven to roar,"},{"s":35.64,"e":39.18,"text":"Kick fear off the hinges, blow open the door."},{"s":39.18,"e":42.98,"text":"I’ve been carrying mountains nobody else sees,"},{"s":42.98,"e":46.76,"text":"But tonight I’m on my knees and I’m calling the King."},{"s":46.76,"e":46.84,"text":"Pre-Chorus"},{"s":46.76,"e":48.54,"text":"Let the light come down,"},{"s":48.54,"e":50.28,"text":"Let the walls fall flat,"},{"s":50.28,"e":52.2,"text":"Let the dead things rise,"},{"s":52.2,"e":55.78,"text":"Let my strength come back."},{"s":55.78,"e":55.86,"text":"Chorus"},{"s":55.78,"e":59.34,"text":"Blast me out of my problems, Lord, lift me high,"},{"s":59.34,"e":63.22,"text":"Put thunder in my chest and Your fire in my eyes."},{"s":63.22,"e":66.62,"text":"Break every curse, every trap, every chain,"},{"s":66.62,"e":70.26,"text":"Wash my soul clean in Your holy rain."},{"s":70.26,"e":73.8,"text":"I’m not buried, I’m planted, I’m rising through pain,"},{"s":73.8,"e":77.46,"text":"I’m not finished, I’m chosen, I’m called by name."},{"s":77.66,"e":80.86,"text":"Heaven come heavy, let the darkness divide,"},{"s":80.86,"e":84.76,"text":"Blast me out of my problems and into Your light."},{"s":84.76,"e":84.84,"text":"Verse 2"},{"s":84.76,"e":88.66,"text":"Send angels to the corners of my broken mind,"},{"s":88.66,"e":92.04,"text":"Sweep out every shadow that I left behind."},{"s":92.04,"e":95.42,"text":"Turn pressure into power, turn wounds into gold,"},{"s":95.42,"e":99.1,"text":"Turn the fear that held me into faith in my bones."},{"s":99.1,"e":102.64,"text":"Let my family be covered, let my friends be fed,"},{"s":102.64,"e":106.3,"text":"Let the lost find a table, let the hungry get bread."},{"s":106.3,"e":109.74,"text":"Let the homeless find shelter, let the lonely find peace,"},{"s":109.74,"e":113.42,"text":"Let the war in my spirit finally bow and cease."},{"s":113.42,"e":113.5,"text":"Pre-Chorus"},{"s":113.42,"e":115.34,"text":"Let the light come down,"},{"s":115.34,"e":117.08,"text":"Let the walls fall flat,"},{"s":117.08,"e":118.94,"text":"Let the dead things rise,"},{"s":118.94,"e":122.48,"text":"Let my strength come back."},{"s":122.48,"e":122.56,"text":"Chorus"},{"s":122.48,"e":126.16,"text":"Blast me out of my problems, Lord, lift me high,"},{"s":126.16,"e":129.92,"text":"Put thunder in my chest and Your fire in my eyes."},{"s":129.92,"e":133.34,"text":"Break every curse, every trap, every chain,"},{"s":133.34,"e":136.94,"text":"Wash my soul clean in Your holy rain."},{"s":136.94,"e":140.5,"text":"I’m not buried, I’m planted, I’m rising through pain,"},{"s":140.5,"e":144.18,"text":"I’m not finished, I’m chosen, I’m called by name."},{"s":144.18,"e":147.54,"text":"Heaven come heavy, let the darkness divide,"},{"s":147.54,"e":152.5,"text":"Blast me out of my problems and into Your light."},{"s":152.5,"e":152.58,"text":"Bridge"},{"s":152.5,"e":155.84,"text":"I speak life over my breath,"},{"s":156.52,"e":159.84,"text":"I speak peace over my sleep,"},{"s":159.84,"e":163.12,"text":"I speak strength over my hands,"},{"s":163.12,"e":166.66,"text":"I speak victory over me."},{"s":166.66,"e":168.4,"text":"No weapon, no shame,"},{"s":168.52,"e":170.16,"text":"No sickness of soul,"},{"s":170.16,"e":171.92,"text":"No debt, no despair,"},{"s":172.14,"e":173.8,"text":"No pit, no hole."},{"s":173.8,"e":175.8,"text":"Can swallow the child"},{"s":175.84,"e":177.46,"text":"You lifted from dust,"},{"s":177.46,"e":179.18,"text":"I give You my fear,"},{"s":179.4,"e":182.78,"text":"You give me Your trust."},{"s":182.78,"e":183.02,"text":"Final Chorus"},{"s":183.14,"e":187.28,"text":"Blast me out of my problems, Lord, raise me anew,"},{"s":187.36,"e":191.26,"text":"Let my whole life become living proof."},{"s":191.26,"e":194.44,"text":"Break every curse, every trap, every chain,"},{"s":194.44,"e":197.62,"text":"Let mercy come roaring like a hurricane."},{"s":197.62,"e":201.58,"text":"I’m not buried, I’m planted, I’m rising through pain,"},{"s":201.58,"e":205.2,"text":"I’m not finished, I’m chosen, I’m called by name."},{"s":205.2,"e":208.62,"text":"Heaven come heavy, let the darkness divide,"},{"s":208.62,"e":212.44,"text":"Blast me out of my problems and into Your light."},{"s":212.44,"e":212.52,"text":"Outro"},{"s":212.44,"e":215.98,"text":"Into Your light, into Your flame,"},{"s":215.98,"e":219.6,"text":"Into Your purpose, into Your name."},{"s":219.6,"e":223.1,"text":"I leave the grave, I leave the night,"},{"s":223.1,"e":228.36,"text":"I rise with God, I rise with light"}],"duration":234.92,"source":"whisper-aligned","generatedAt":"2026-06-17T12:24:27.156Z","stats":{"whisperWords":524,"polishedWords":526,"matched":502,"matchRate":0.954}}